  "title": "Field boundary tiles 2025 (test)",
  "description": "TEST catalog — candidate renderings of the 2025 Fields of the World PRUE predictions (1.58B field polygons), one collection per approach for side-by-side preview: A5 cell aggregates at three resolutions (r5/r7/r8, PMTiles + GeoParquet + styles) and the full thinned-polygon archive. Built with geoparquet-io (A5 aggregation) and tylertoo (tiling). The production per-year handover archives (a5 r7 cells z0–8 into full fields z9–13, 2024 & 2025, deduped and ≤350 km²) will land here as their own collection.",
